      "text": "MOFA 的输入描述允许相同或重叠的样本集合，但并未定义任意缺失模态或样本对应关系的通用兼容性规则。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 cell_identity_link=none 表示两个 view 之间没有细胞身份对应关系，因此无法确认 RNA 与 ATAC 样本是否来自同一或重叠的细胞集合。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:cell_identity_link"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MOFA 的官方文档说明其输入是同一或重叠样本集合上的多组学矩阵，但该描述本身不构成对任意缺失对应关系的适用性断言。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在缺少细胞身份链接的情况下，无法从现有证据判断 MOFA+ 能否对来自不同队列且无对应关系的 RNA 与 ATAC 细胞进行有意义的跨模态因子学习。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "两个 view 的样本是否来自同一批细胞或存在可用的细胞身份对应关系？",
    "missing_field": "cell_identity_link",
    "why_needed": "MOFA 的输入描述要求相同或重叠的样本集合；若没有细胞身份链接，无法判断跨模态因子学习是否适用于当前数据。"
  }
}
